  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**((525+175)²-(525-175)²)/((525 × 175))**\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\na² - b² = (a - b)(a + b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n**((525+175)²-(525-175)²)/((525 × 175))**\n\n⇒ **((700)²-(350)²)/((525 × 175))**\n\n⇒ **((700 - 350) × (700 +350))/((525 × 175))**\n\n⇒ **(350 × 1050)/((525 × 175))**\n\n⇒ 2 × 2 = 4\n\n**∴ Option 2 is the correct answer.**\n\n97:T8",
